*Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*6 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Mega Baa Baa]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
