**6 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Mega Baa Baa]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**2 [[Zapy|Zapies]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
