**1 [[Great Angel Chibinel]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] and [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] both work here as meatshields, but they'll need to be very high in level and won't hold their ground forever. [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Ectoweight Cat]] and [[Piledriver Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Piledriver Cat]] can work against most of the Zombies, while talented [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Cataurs]] can attack Cadaver Bear. [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Naala]] can snipe Chibinel especially well in its True Form, but avoid using [[Surge Attack|Surges]], as Mega Baa Baa can deflect these and ruin your backline. Your [[Cat Cannon]] should be Holy Blast, for what are hopefully obvious reasons.

